# Artifact content is transient — ignore everything
*

# But keep directory structure via .gitkeep
!.gitignore
!**/.gitkeep

# ADRs are stable architectural decisions — always committed
!decisions/
!decisions/*.md

# ASRs are architectural requirements — always committed
!requirements/*.md

# Completed design docs are committed for auditability
!designs/completed/*.md
!designs/completed/**/*.md

# Plan examples are committed — agents use them as templates (no plan-gen tool yet)
!plans/examples/
!plans/examples/*.md

# Archived skills (with superseded-by policy README) are durable cleanup deliverables — committed
!skills/
!skills/archive/
!skills/archive/README.md
!skills/archive/*/
!skills/archive/**/SKILL.md
